Z||000001||GT Bastard||07-05-2000||12:05 PM||||Sounds like a vacuum line came loose somewhere. I'd check around the EGR selenoid first.||||reg||1
Z||000002||ROB MAC||07-05-2000||12:16 PM||||I would start by cleaning all electrical connections and check for vacuum leaks.<BR>If that doesn't help check idle sensor.<BR>Also idle problems can be caused by other bad components such as headlight relays, alternators, loose belt,map sensor, e.g.r., or in worst case a bad computer. The hunt is part of the fun of owning this piece of art.||||reg||1
